+- [x] 1.2 Add `CouponService.redeem(code, amountCents, now)` returning `{ coupon, discountCents }` and throwing HTTP 400 `COUPON_NOT_FOUND`, `COUPON_NOT_ACTIVE`, `COUPON_EXPIRED`, `COUPON_NOT_YET_VALID`, `COUPON_MIN_AMOUNT_NOT_MET`; verify each code with a test in `tests/apply-coupon.test.ts`
+- [x] 1.3 Implement `FIXED` and `PERCENT` discount arithmetic (floor for percent, `maxDiscountCents` cap, never above the order amount); verify with the fixed/percent/cap-total cases in `tests/apply-coupon.test.ts`
+
+## 2. Order pricing persistence
+
+- [x] 2.1 Add `OrderRepository.updatePricing(id, { discountCents, finalAmountCents, couponCode })`; verify `npm run build` and a test asserting the stored order reflects the new pricing
+- [x] 2.2 Wrap the order update plus redemption insert in a `BEGIN`/`COMMIT` with rollback on failure inside the service; verify `npm run build` passes and the happy path test still persists both writes
+
+## 3. Order service and wiring
+
+- [x] 3.1 Add `OrderService.applyCoupon(id, couponCode)` that loads the order (404 `ORDER_NOT_FOUND`), validates the coupon code input (400 `INVALID_REQUEST`), redeems via `CouponService`, persists pricing and returns the updated order; verify the returned order matches `GET /orders/:id` in `tests/apply-coupon.test.ts`
+- [x] 3.2 Inject `CouponService` into `OrderService` in `app.ts`; verify `npm run build` and `npm test` both pass
+
+## 4. HTTP endpoint
+
+- [x] 4.1 Register `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` in `src/routes/orders.ts`; verify status 200 with the updated order for a valid coupon and 400 for each invalid coupon in `tests/apply-coupon.test.ts`
+
+## 5. Integration verification
+
+- [x] 5.1 Run `npm run build` and `npm test`; verify the whole suite (existing `tests/orders.test.ts` plus `tests/apply-coupon.test.ts`) passes with no regressions
+- [x] 5.2 Run `openspec validate order-apply-coupon`; verify the change validates (specs, design and tasks consistent with the implementation)
+
+## Workflow follow-up
+
+- Archive the change with the archive workflow once review is satisfied.
